  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "An unofficial NELFUND guide for Nigerian tertiary students. Readiness checks, application steps, troubleshooting, FAQs and video guides, all clearly labelled as verified, may-change, general guidance, or unverified. Institution-aware architecture for students at any Nigerian tertiary institution.",
